"The point of sale of the branch where this wall hangs. Its Xibo server is "
"the one the wall is published on."
msgstr ""
"La caja de la sucursal donde está este muro. Su servidor Xibo es donde se "
"publica el muro."

#. module: xb_showroom_wall_xibo
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xb_showroom_wall_xibo.field_xb_showroom_screen__xibo_display_id
