"The screen (or videowall) in Xibo that shows this wall. The layout is built "
"on its canvas, so a 5760x1080 videowall gets the whole surface."
msgstr ""
"La pantalla (o videowall) de Xibo que muestra este muro. La disposición se "
"arma a su tamaño, así que un videowall de 5760x1080 se ocupa completo."

#. module: xb_showroom_wall_xibo
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xb_showroom_wall_xibo.field_xb_showroom_screen__xibo_previous_layout_xibo_id
